  "body": "Positioned just moments from the coastline, Coastal Rise’s most premium residence offers a rare and final opportunity to secure the standout home within this boutique development. Located approximately 400 metres from Big Manly Beach, 500 metres from Little Manly Beach, and only 50 metres from Manly Village, this last remaining home delivers exceptional coastal living in an unbeatable location.\r\nSet on an expansive 231sqm land parcel—significantly larger than a standard townhouse—this architecturally designed home spans a generous 127sqm. Unlike higher-density developments, the developer has intentionally not maximised site coverage, resulting in a noticeably more spacious, light-filled residence with an abundance of storage throughout.\r\nEnjoy exceptional elevated views over Little Manly Beach and Brandon Reserve, seamlessly blending relaxed beachside living with contemporary comfort. High-end finishes and modern styling are complemented by practical luxury, including a secure internal-access single garage plus three additional allocated car parks. The extra parking located directly beside the home is ideal for a boat, caravan, jet ski, or additional vehicles—a rare and highly sought-after feature this close to the coast.\r\nPublic transport is at your doorstep, with the nearby Gulf Harbour Ferry providing a scenic and stress-free commute to Auckland’s CBD. Zoned for Whangaparaoa College and Whangaparaoa Primary, and surrounded by quality early learning centres, this home is perfectly suited to families, professionals, and lifestyle-focused buyers alike.\r\n\r\nDISCLAIMER - Photos depicted are from the display unit, 935A.",
